### @name PasswordLogin

POST {{rootUrl}}/auth/login
# Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"email": "admin@example.com",
	"password": "password@123-local"
}

### @name PasswordRegister

POST {{rootUrl}}/auth/register
# Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"email": "admin@example.com",
	"password": "password@123-local"
}

### @name GetVerificationLink

GET {{rootUrl}}/auth/verification-link?userId=123
